\newlabel{fig:sameratio}{{6}{45}{\textbf {The surrogate discriminates at one fixed budget.} Predicted $\tfrac 12 s^\top \Hmat s$ against measured $\KL (p_0\|p_S)$ over $26$ prunings matched to within $0.75\%$ of the same removed cost on Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct at $\rho {=}20\%$: the \method and diagonal greedy sets, ten local swaps of the former, and fourteen random sets. Every random set is above every structured one; within the structured cluster the rank correlation is $0.55$}{figure.caption.35}{}}
